            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="d264-04" n="4" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76ve08/d264-04"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume E–8, Documents on South Asia, 1973–1976.
                    <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. Documents <ref target="#d94">94</ref> and <ref
                                target="#d95">95</ref> (date of correction: November 2, 2021)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>After publication, it was discovered that Document 94 and Document 95 were
                        transposed and included incorrect headings. Editors supplied the correct
                        text for Documents 94 and 95.</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. Document <ref target="#d220">220</ref> (date of
                            correction: February 1, 2017)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>After publication, it was discovered that Document 220 contained the
                        repeated text of Document 219. Editors supplied the correct text for
                        Document 220.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
